# Audio assets - licence and attribution

Every file under `assets/audio/` is **CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)**.
No attribution is legally required. This file records it anyway, because a licence
nobody can trace back to a source is a licence nobody can check, and because the
rpm -> layer table in `Audio/engine_samples.gd` is derived from measurements of
these exact files rather than from their filenames.

The synthesiser in `Audio/engine_synth.gd` is original game content and is the
fallback when any of the files below is missing; it is not covered by this file.

---

## Files

